      "id": "A1",
      "text": "Is 12 months in the first or second breathing-rate band, and is age measured in completed months?"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2",
      "text": "What should a CHW do for a child outside the 2 months to 5 years range?"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3",
      "text": "General danger signs are only asked when cough is present; WHO checks them for every sick child."
    },
    {
      "id": "A4",
      "text": "The wheeze bronchodilator trial before classification is not modelled."
    },
    {
      "id": "A5",
      "text": "COUGH OR COLD follow-up applies only if not improving; the model schedules it unconditionally."
    },
    {
      "id": "A6",
      "text": "No plausible upper bound for breaths per minute is given."
    },
    {
      "id": "A7",
      "text": "The chart booklet targets facility health workers; CHW suitability of chest indrawing and stridor assessment is undecided."
    },
